<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Karrington cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Karrington cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney cut its rating on the shares of Karrington Health Inc to neutral from buy, a source at the brokerage firm said.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Late Wednesday, the company reported second quarter earnings of a loss of $0.08 per share versus a loss of $0.15 per share in the year.</p>
<p>-- The stock lost 3-3/8 to 13-1/8.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
